{
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "transfer.v1.DustConversionService",
      "doc": "DustConversionService converts dust, Trading balances too small to trade, into\n one target asset at index prices less a disclosed fee. A conversion moves\n every source and credits the payout atomically, or moves nothing.\n\n Limits: a balance converts when no open market accepts an order for it and it\n is worth at most 10 USD; one conversion takes at most 20 balances worth at\n most 200 USD together; an account converts once every 6 hours, refused\n conversions excepted; each target has a daily conversion limit.\n\n Quoting, converting and reading conversions need the CONVERT_DUST permission;\n listing balances needs READ_BALANCES. Sessions have both for the root\n account. On a subaccount, the role must be owner, admin, trader or leveraged\n trader, and the subaccount's policy must grant CONVERT_DUST, which its\n default policy does not. An API key's policy must grant CONVERT_DUST, and a\n subaccount-scoped key's subaccount policy too. No step-up is required: the\n value stays in the account.",
      "methods": [
        {
          "name": "CreateDustConversion",
          "path": "transfer.v1.DustConversionService/CreateDustConversion",
          "requestType": "transfer.v1.CreateDustConversionRequest",
          "responseType": "transfer.v1.CreateDustConversionResponse",
          "summary": "Convert a quote at current index prices, or return the conversion already",
          "doc": "Convert a quote at current index prices, or return the conversion already\n made under the idempotency key. Every source must still be the whole\n available balance the quote showed. A refused conversion moves nothing.\n\n Errors:\n - FAILED_PRECONDITION: DUST_QUOTE_EXPIRED, DUST_PRICE_MOVED (the payout fell\n   more than 1% below the quote), DUST_NOT_ELIGIBLE (a quoted balance is no\n   longer dust), DUST_TARGET_UNAVAILABLE, DUST_BALANCE_CHANGED (a source\n   balance moved since the quote) or DUST_CONVERSION_FAILED.\n - RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED: DUST_WINDOW_ACTIVE (the account converted within the\n   last 6 hours or a conversion is still processing), DUST_DAILY_LIMIT or\n   DUST_BUSY (retry shortly).\n - ALREADY_EXISTS: IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT (the key or the quote was used for\n   another conversion).\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: PERMISSION_DENIED or POLICY_DENIED.\n - UNAVAILABLE: SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE or ACCOUNT_SHARD_UNAVAILABLE; retry the\n   same request.",
          "tags": [
            "account"
          ],
          "authRequired": true,
          "authenticationMethods": [
            "session_token",
            "api_key"
          ],
          "mfaRequirement": "none",
          "stability": "stable",
          "errorProtoPkg": "transfer.v1",
          "errorCatalog": "internal-transfer-api:transfererrors",
          "examples": {
            "request": {
              "idempotencyKey": "idem_01J5EXAMPLE0000000000000",
              "quoteId": "dq_6f1d2c3b4a5968778695a4b3c2d1e0f1",
              "subaccountId": "6789012345678"
            },
            "response": {
              "conversion": {
                "completedAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                "conversionId": "289356276058554368451847372193536",
                "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                "feeBps": 1,
                "feeE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "payoutE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "quoteId": "dq_6f1d2c3b4a5968778695a4b3c2d1e0f1",
                "quotedPayoutE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "refusalCode": "ERROR_CODE_INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS",
                "sources": [
                  {
                    "amountE18": {
                      "hi": "1",
                      "lo": "1"
                    },
                    "assetId": 100
                  }
                ],
                "state": "DUST_CONVERSION_STATE_PROCESSING",
                "targetAssetId": 100
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GetDustConversion",
          "path": "transfer.v1.DustConversionService/GetDustConversion",
          "requestType": "transfer.v1.GetDustConversionRequest",
          "responseType": "transfer.v1.GetDustConversionResponse",
          "summary": "Read one of the account's conversions.",
          "doc": "Read one of the account's conversions.\n\n Errors:\n - NOT_FOUND: NOT_FOUND.\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: PERMISSION_DENIED or POLICY_DENIED.\n - UNAVAILABLE: SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE; retry later.",
          "tags": [
            "account"
          ],
          "authRequired": true,
          "authenticationMethods": [
            "session_token",
            "api_key"
          ],
          "mfaRequirement": "none",
          "stability": "stable",
          "errorProtoPkg": "transfer.v1",
          "errorCatalog": "internal-transfer-api:transfererrors",
          "examples": {
            "request": {
              "conversionId": "289356276058554368451847372193536",
              "subaccountId": "6789012345678"
            },
            "response": {
              "conversion": {
                "completedAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                "conversionId": "289356276058554368451847372193536",
