        {
          "name": "QuoteDustConversion",
          "path": "transfer.v1.DustConversionService/QuoteDustConversion",
          "requestType": "transfer.v1.QuoteDustConversionRequest",
          "responseType": "transfer.v1.QuoteDustConversionResponse",
          "summary": "Price the account's dust into a target. The quote is valid for 30 seconds",
          "doc": "Price the account's dust into a target. The quote is valid for 30 seconds\n and reserves nothing.\n\n Errors:\n - INVALID_ARGUMENT: INVALID_REQUEST (target_asset_id is not a target) or\n   INVALID_SUBACCOUNT_ID.\n - FAILED_PRECONDITION: DUST_TARGET_UNAVAILABLE (the target cannot be paid\n   now or has no current price) or SOURCE_ACCOUNT_INACTIVE.\n - NOT_FOUND: SUBACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND.\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: PERMISSION_DENIED or POLICY_DENIED.\n - UNAVAILABLE: SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE; retry later.",
          "tags": [
